# Cursor AI Rules - Degusta Chopp Website

- Always respond in Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR).
- Tech Stack: React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS v3, Lucide Icons.
- Design System: Dark Mode Neumorphic (Dark Green #0a160d / #142718, Amber/Gold accents #f59e0b).
- Catalog Grid Rules: 2 columns grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 max-w-6xl mx-auto. Last card centered when odd using `lg:col-span-2 lg:max-w-[calc(50%-1rem)] lg:mx-auto w-full`.
- Price Table Rules: CSS Grid 3 columns `grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr] gap-3`. Price badges enclosed in rectangular boxes with `min-h-[44px] text-lg lg:text-xl font-extrabold whitespace-nowrap`.
- Always verify changes with `npm run build`.
